
variable totLength equal 10

variable seed equal 1
units si
boundary p p p

atom_style molecular

region main block -100 100 -100 100 -100 100

create_box 11 main bond/types 10 angle/types 9 extra/bond/per/atom 2 extra/angle/per/atom 3 extra/special/per/atom 6
Created orthogonal box = (-100 -100 -100) to (100 100 100)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid

molecule raw_WLC_11_Atoms Structures/Raw/raw_WLC_11.txt
Read molecule template raw_WLC_11_Atoms:
# Molecule File for a Worm-Like Chain with 11 atoms
  1 molecules
  0 fragments
  11 atoms with max type 11
  10 bonds with max type 10
  9 angles with max type 9
  0 dihedrals with max type 0
  0 impropers with max type 0
bond_style harmonic
bond_coeff * 0 1
angle_style harmonic
angle_coeff * 0 180

create_atoms 0 single 0 0 0 mol raw_WLC_11_Atoms ${seed} rotate 0 0 0 1
create_atoms 0 single 0 0 0 mol raw_WLC_11_Atoms 1 rotate 0 0 0 1
Created 11 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (-100 -100 -100) to (100 100 100)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds

read_data Structures/Coeffs/coeffs_WLC_11.data add merge
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (-100 -100 -100) to (100 100 100)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
  special bond factors lj:    0        0        0       
  special bond factors coul:  0        0        0       
     3 = max # of 1-2 neighbors
     6 = max # of 1-3 neighbors
    18 = max # of 1-4 neighbors
    13 = max # of special neighbors
  special bonds CPU = 0.000 seconds
  read_data CPU = 0.001 seconds


group internals type 2:10
9 atoms in group internals
group endpoints subtract all internals
2 atoms in group endpoints


compute bondID all property/local btype batom1 batom2
compute angleID all property/local atype aatom1 aatom2 aatom3

variable k_restrain equal 100

fix restraint all arclengthrestraint raw_WLC_11_Atoms ${k_restrain} ${totLength}
fix restraint all arclengthrestraint raw_WLC_11_Atoms 100 ${totLength}
fix restraint all arclengthrestraint raw_WLC_11_Atoms 100 10



comm_modify cutoff 100

fix stationary endpoints setforce 0 0 0
min_modify dmax 5 norm max
minimize 0.0 0 1000000000 1000000000
Neighbor list info ...
  update: every = 1 steps, delay = 0 steps, check = yes
  max neighbors/atom: 2000, page size: 100000
  master list distance cutoff = 0
  ghost atom cutoff = 100
  binsize = 200, bins = 1 1 1
  1 neighbor lists, perpetual/occasional/extra = 1 0 0
  (1) fix arclengthrestraint, perpetual
      attributes: half, newton on
      pair build: half/bin/newton
      stencil: half/bin/3d
      bin: standard
